    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash map + doubly linked list</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/lru-cache/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 146</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>LRU Cache</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The map finds a key's node, the doubly linked list keeps the order of use, and the node stores its own key so the evicted tail can be erased from the map too. get and put are both O(1); memory O(capacity).</p>\n"
